<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"NewsArticle","headline":"Genel Merkez, il ba\u015fkan\u0131n\u0131 cezaland\u0131racak m\u0131?","dateCreated":"2026-10-31T13:32:00+03:00","datePublished":"2026-10-31T13:32:00+03:00","dateModified":"2026-10-31T13:43:47+03:00","wordCount":435,"genre":"news","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https:\/\/www.gazeteekspres.com\/genel-merkez-il-baskanini-cezalandiracak-mi"},"articleBody":"Partinin kurulu\u015fu ilan edilirken Genel Ba\u015fkan \u00d6zel, Yeni Parti\u2019nin stat\u00fckoya kar\u015f\u0131, bir yenilenme arzusunun sonucu oldu\u011funu dile getirmi\u015fti.\r\n\r\nStat\u00fcko; yani \u00f6teden beri s\u00fcr\u00fcp gelen durum.\r\n\r\nToplum da CHP\u2019deki yanl\u0131\u015flar\u0131n, sorunlar\u0131n olmayaca\u011f\u0131 umuduyla Yeni Parti\u2019ye y\u00f6nelmi\u015fti.\r\n\r\nCHP\u2019nin kongrelerinde hi\u00e7bir zaman kad\u0131n ve gen\u00e7 kotas\u0131 dikkate al\u0131nmam\u0131\u015ft\u0131.\r\n\r\nAma \u00d6zg\u00fcr \u00d6zel, bu durumun Yeni Parti\u2019de olmayaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 ilan etmi\u015fti.\r\n\r\nBunun i\u00e7in Parti t\u00fcz\u00fc\u011f\u00fcnde il-il\u00e7e y\u00f6netimleri ve kurultay delegeli\u011fi listelerinde y\u00fczde 50 cinsiyet kotas\u0131 konulmu\u015ftu.\r\n\r\nHatta bu konuda o kadar titiz davran\u0131lm\u0131\u015f ki \u201cyeni kurulduk\u201d bahanelerine s\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131lmas\u0131n diye ge\u00e7ici madde bile eklenmi\u015fti.\r\n\r\nYani parti t\u00fcz\u00fc\u011f\u00fc, \u201cSak\u0131n ha cinsiyet kotas\u0131n\u0131 ihmal etmeyin\u201d mesaj\u0131 veriyordu.\r\n\r\n**\r\n\r\nPeki bu kadar s\u00f6yleme, t\u00fcz\u00fck maddelerine ra\u011fmen Yeni Parti Gaziantep \u0130l Y\u00f6netimi\u2019nde ka\u00e7 kad\u0131n \u00fcye var?\r\n\r\nSadece 4\r\n\r\nKa\u00e7 kad\u0131n kurultay delegesi var?\r\n\r\nYaz\u0131yla bir, rakamla 1\u2026\r\n\r\n\u015eimdi say\u0131n \u00fcyeyi 28 kurultay delegesi aras\u0131na girdi\u011fi i\u00e7in kutlayal\u0131m m\u0131,\r\n\r\nBelediye Meclis \u00dcyesi Mahmut Demirel\u2019in k\u0131z\u0131 oldu\u011fu i\u00e7in soru i\u015fareti mi b\u0131rakal\u0131m?\r\n\r\n**\r\n\r\nT\u00fcz\u00fck son derece net\u2026\r\n\r\nMadde 36 : \u0130l ve il\u00e7e y\u00f6netim kurullar\u0131nda, il kongre delegeleri ve kurultay delegelerinde y\u00fczde elli (%50) cinsiyet kotas\u0131 uygulan\u0131r.\r\n\r\nGe\u00e7ici Madde -3: Cinsiyet kotas\u0131, 1. Ola\u011fan Kurultaya kadar y\u00fczde otuz \u00fc\u00e7 (%33) uygulan\u0131r.\r\n\r\n**\r\n\r\nT\u00fcz\u00fck bu kadar netken, Yeni Parti Gaziantep \u0130l Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Erhan Deniz G\u00fcngen, 36 ki\u015filik il y\u00f6netiminde 4 kad\u0131n, 28 ki\u015filik kurultay delegesi listesinde ise 1 kad\u0131n \u00fcyeye yer verdi.\r\n\r\nBu durum alenen parti t\u00fcz\u00fc\u011f\u00fcne ayk\u0131r\u0131 hareket etmektir.\r\n\r\nAlenen \u201cparti t\u00fcz\u00fc\u011f\u00fcn\u00fc takm\u0131yorum\u201d demektir.\r\n\r\nSay\u0131n Genel Merkez Y\u00f6neticileri, bir il ba\u015fkan\u0131 d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcn\u00fcn.\r\n\r\nSizin yazd\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z kurallara, t\u00fcz\u00fc\u011fe uymuyor.\r\n\r\nVatanda\u015f\u0131, yar\u0131n iktidar oldu\u011funuzda yasalara, hukuka uygun davranaca\u011f\u0131na nas\u0131l inand\u0131racaks\u0131n\u0131z?\r\n\r\n**\r\n\r\nSay\u0131n Genel Merkez Y\u00f6neticileri;\r\n\r\nT\u00fcz\u00fc\u011f\u00fcn b\u00fct\u00fcn maddeleri son derece net.\r\n\r\nMadde 48. Programa, T\u00dcZ\u00dcK kurallar\u0131na ayk\u0131r\u0131 davrananlar i\u00e7in KES\u0130N \u00c7IKARMA cezas\u0131 uygulan\u0131r.\r\n\r\nT\u00fcz\u00fc\u011f\u00fcn net olmas\u0131na ra\u011fmen, Gaziantep \u00f6rg\u00fct\u00fcn\u00fcn isyan\u0131na ra\u011fmen, kimsenin sesi \u00e7\u0131kmay\u0131nca, sormak yine bize d\u00fc\u015ft\u00fc:\r\n\r\nGaziantep \u0130l Ba\u015fkan\u0131n\u0131 T\u00fcz\u00fc\u011fe Ayk\u0131r\u0131 hareketi nedeniyle disipline sevk edecek misiniz?\r\n\r\nCevab\u0131n\u0131z, bize Yeni Parti\u2019de STAT\u00dcKO\u2019nun devam edip etmedi\u011fini de ortaya koyacak\u2026\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","description":"Partinin kurulu\u015fu ilan edilirken Genel Ba\u015fkan \u00d6zel, Yeni Parti\u2019nin stat\u00fckoya kar\u015f\u0131, bir yenilenme arzusunun sonucu oldu\u011funu dile getirmi\u015fti. Stat\u00fcko; yani\u2026","inLanguage":"tr-TR","keywords":[],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/gazeteeksprescom.teimg.com\/crop\/1280x720\/gazeteekspres-com\/uploads\/2026\/10\/bora-zor-3.jpeg","width":"1280","height":"720","caption":"Genel Merkez, il ba\u015fkan\u0131n\u0131 cezaland\u0131racak m\u0131?"},"isFamilyFriendly":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","isAccessibleForFree":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.gazeteekspres.com\/#organization","name":"Gaziantep  Ekspres Gazetesi","image":"https:\/\/gazeteeksprescom.teimg.com\/gazeteekspres-com\/uploads\/2024\/11\/lg1-1680680196-172.png","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/gazeteeksprescom.teimg.com\/gazeteekspres-com\/uploads\/2024\/11\/lg1-1680680196-172.png","width":"640","height":"375"}},"author":{"@type":"Person","@id":"https:\/\/www.gazeteekspres.com\/mbora-zor#person","name":"M.Bora Zor","url":"https:\/\/www.gazeteekspres.com\/mbora-zor"},"creator":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.gazeteekspres.com\/#organization","name":"Gaziantep  Ekspres Gazetesi","url":"https:\/\/www.gazeteekspres.com"}}</script>


